The only pod with abnormal restarts or readiness loss is the search pod; geo's restart count of 7 is identical in normal and abnormal periods. I have enough to write up.

```json
{
  "root_causes": [
    {
      "service": "search",
      "fault_kind": "pod_unavailable",
      "evidence": [
        {"kind": "metric",
         "sql": "SELECT time, metric, value FROM abnormal_metrics WHERE attr_k8s_pod_name='search-8457767968-wsp42' AND metric IN ('k8s.container.ready','k8s.container.restarts') ORDER BY metric, time",
         "claim": "Search pod stays not ready (ready=0) for the whole abnormal window while its restart count climbs from 3 to 6."},
        {"kind": "metric",
         "sql": "SELECT attr_k8s_pod_name pod, metric, min(value) mn, max(value) mx FROM normal_metrics WHERE attr_k8s_pod_name='search-8457767968-wsp42' AND metric IN ('k8s.container.ready','k8s.container.restarts') GROUP BY 1,2",
         "claim": "In the normal period the search pod is ready (1) with zero restarts."},
        {"kind": "trace",
         "sql": "SELECT service_name, span_name, attr_status_code, count(*) n, avg(duration)/1e6 avg_ms FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name='frontend' AND span_name LIKE '%search%' GROUP BY 1,2,3",
         "claim": "Frontend's calls to search.Search/Nearby all return Error in about 0.02 ms, and no search spans are emitted."}
      ]
    }
  ],
  "propagation": [
    {"from": "search", "to": "frontend",
     "evidence": [
       {"kind": "trace",
        "sql": "SELECT span_name, attr_status_code, count(*) n FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name='frontend' AND span_name IN ('HTTP /hotels','search.Search/Nearby') GROUP BY 1,2",
        "claim": "Frontend's HTTP /hotels requests fail with Error status in step with its failing search.Search/Nearby calls."},
       {"kind": "log",
        "sql": "SELECT service_name, level, message, count(*) c FROM abnormal_logs WHERE level='ERROR' GROUP BY 1,2,3 ORDER BY c DESC",
        "claim": "Frontend logs ERROR 'Search service failed' repeatedly during the incident window, with no such errors in normal data."}
     ]}
  ]
}
```

